Patch for the English version of Warhammer Dark Omen.

Adds a Mod menu to the main menu to make selecting of mods easier.

## HD Movie Playback

This fork adds the ability to replace any in-game movie with a modern
video file, played through a bundled copy of ffplay (from FFmpeg).

Setup:
- Place `ffplay.exe` in the `PRG_ENG` folder alongside `darkpatch.dll`
- Create an `HDMovies` folder next to `MOVIES` and `PRG_ENG` (i.e. one
  level up from PRG_ENG, in the main Dark Omen folder)
- Drop in a replacement named after the original movie, e.g.
  `HDMovies\eng.mp4` for the startup movie

Movies without a matching HD replacement play exactly as they always
have, through the original unmodified game code.

See discussion thread at http://forum.dark-omen.org/tools/mod-selector-t1118.0.html

